(24, 1, '2026-06-04 08:56:54', '2026-06-04 08:56:54', 'Browse your destination country, review the requirements and documents, then message us on WhatsApp. Our team will guide you through every step.', 'How do I apply for a visa through DreamVisaGuide?', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'how-do-i-apply-for-a-visa-through-dreamvisaguide', '', '', '2026-06-04 08:56:54', '2026-06-04 08:56:54', '', 0, 'https://dreamvisaguide.com/?faq=how-do-i-apply-for-a-visa-through-dreamvisaguide', 0, 'faq', '', 0),
(25, 1, '2026-06-04 08:56:54', '2026-06-04 08:56:54', 'We list indicative government fees and our service options. Final fees may vary by nationality and visa type — contact us for an exact quote.', 'Are the visa fees on this site official?', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'are-the-visa-fees-on-this-site-official', '', '', '2026-06-04 08:56:54', '2026-06-04 08:56:54', '', 0, 'https://dreamvisaguide.com/?faq=are-the-visa-fees-on-this-site-official', 0, 'faq', '', 0),
(26, 1, '2026-06-04 08:56:54', '2026-06-04 08:56:54', 'It depends on the country and visa type, ranging from a few days (eVisas) to several weeks. Each country page shows the current processing time.', 'How long does visa processing take?', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'how-long-does-visa-processing-take', '', '', '2026-06-04 08:56:54', '2026-06-04 08:56:54', '', 0, 'https://dreamvisaguide.com/?faq=how-long-does-visa-processing-take', 0, 'faq', '', 0),
(27, 1, '2026-06-04 08:56:54', '2026-06-04 08:56:54', 'Yes. We help you prepare documents, fill applications correctly and avoid common mistakes that cause rejections.', 'Do you offer document and application support?', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'do-you-offer-document-and-application-support', '', '', '2026-06-04 08:56:54', '2026-06-04 08:56:54', '', 0, 'https://dreamvisaguide.com/?faq=do-you-offer-document-and-application-support', 0, 'faq', '', 0),
(28, 1, '2026-06-04 08:56:54', '2026-06-04 08:56:54', 'We currently cover the UAE, Canada, UK and Australia, and we add new destinations regularly.', 'Which countries do you cover?', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'which-countries-do-you-cover', '', '', '2026-06-04 08:56:54', '2026-06-04 08:56:54', '', 0, 'https://dreamvisaguide.com/?faq=which-countries-do-you-cover', 0, 'faq', '', 0),
