(32, 1, '2026-06-04 08:56:54', '2026-06-04 08:56:54', '<p>DreamVisaGuide is your trusted source for accurate, up-to-date visa and travel information. Our mission is simple — <strong>Guide • Plan • Achieve</strong> — helping travellers, students and professionals navigate visa requirements with confidence.</p><p>We provide clear, regularly-updated details on visa types, required documents, processing times and fees for popular destinations, plus the latest immigration news. Whatever your destination, our team is one WhatsApp message away.</p><h2>Why choose us</h2><ul><li>Accurate, regularly updated visa information</li><li>Clear document checklists for every visa type</li><li>Transparent pricing and processing times</li><li>Friendly support over WhatsApp</li></ul>', 'About Us', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'about-us', '', '', '2026-06-04 08:56:54', '2026-06-04 08:56:54', '', 0, 'https://dreamvisaguide.com/about-us/', 0, 'page', '', 0),
